{"id":"8527287e791b6212","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p.md","title":"书中素性复杂度结论及其证据范围","display":"thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p — 书中素性复杂度结论及其证据范围","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p","aliases":["73-thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p"],"display":"thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p — 书中素性复杂度结论及其证据范围","depends_on":["[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]","[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]","[[73-df-binary-p]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.1, print p. 514, and Theorem 11.24, print p. 518; PDF pp. 536, 540","source_status":"source-statements-checked; algorithms/proofs omitted by textbook and not reconstructed here","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p — 书中素性复杂度结论及其证据范围"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"498d8afd65d4a6ee\" href=\"?note=498d8afd65d4a6ee\" title=\"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages\">73-df-primes-and-composites-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c185b4536ca59db\" href=\"?note=1c185b4536ca59db\" title=\"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp\">73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.1, print p. 514, and Theorem 11.24, print p. 518; PDF pp. 536, 540"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statements-checked; algorithms/proofs omitted by textbook and not reconstructed here"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\">\\(\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\)</span> 采用规范二进制表示；随机及确定性多项式类采用已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\in\\mathsf{RP},\\qquad\\mathsf{PRIME}\\in\\mathsf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\in\\mathsf{RP},\\qquad\\mathsf{PRIME}\\in\\mathsf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 11.24 对合数在 RP 中仅给陈述，明确说没有提供处理 Carmichael 数的完整算法；p.514 又陈述素性已有确定多项式算法。这里据原书记录结论，未伪造 AKS 或强伪素数检验的完整构造。简单 Fermat 测试不能独立证明前一结论；后者也不是把因子搜索的数值复杂度误当作位复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages","status":"resolved","id":"498d8afd65d4a6ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp","status":"resolved","id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRIME},\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{COMPOSITE}\\in\\mathsf{RP},\\qquad\\mathsf{PRIME}\\in\\mathsf P.","display":true}],"bytes":1488,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-composites-rp-and-primes-p|书中素性复杂度结论及其证据范围]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["498d8afd65d4a6ee","1c185b4536ca59db","5a23e63a72e2443c"]}